m1n1-nvme-base.c is an unmodified copy of src/nvme.c from:

https://github.com/damsleth/m1n1/blob/16b1f61fd2a995f855da8909411d06005d1e2b35/src/nvme.c

The file retains its SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT declaration. The upstream
MIT license and copyright notice are included in m1n1-nvme-base.LICENSE.
SHA-256: 061b3c6aea60387e90b368eff6c3beeab121a7f4f9e57ec85a4d6cd12a8f1702

This fixture permits patch-application and compiled control-flow tests before
the project's source cache exists. The tests verify its SHA-256 against the
same pinned source identity enforced by lib/nvme_handoff.py during builds.

The same pinned source also supplies m1n1-nvme-base.h,
m1n1-rtkit-base.c and m1n1-rtkit-base.h. Their SPDX MIT declarations and
upstream license remain intact. RTKit base/result hashes are pinned in
lib/nvme_handoff.py so the compiled tests exercise the actual boolean
power-transition implementation rather than a substitute API contract.
